title: PaperShell
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

Layers of kraft paper and natural resin, pressed hard under heat into a shell. The paper comes from wood-industry leftovers.

The company says it produces 98% less CO2 than plastic, fiberglass, or aluminum.

At the end of its life it is meant to be turned into [[BioChar]].

Used for the seat of the [[Catifa Carta]].
